<title>USA: VASCO unit in pact for Japan market.</title>
<headline>VASCO unit in pact for Japan market.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>VASCO Corp said Tuesday that a unit has signed an agreement with Hucom Inc to work exclusively together to develop the Japanese information-security market.</p>
<p>Under the deal, Hucom will represent VASCO Data Security Inc as its exclusive distributor in Japan, and will sell directly to end user clients, as well as through resellers selected, trained and managed by Hucom.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>(-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610)</p>
